{"title":"2019 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 20","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Math-X_(First_understand_the_problem!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Math-X (First understand the problem!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Solution_5_(video_of_Solution_1)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5 (video of Solution 1)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_DDM\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by DDM</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Pi_Academy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Pi Academy</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2_(Gateway_to_Harder_Questions)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2 (Gateway to Harder Questions)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How many different real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> satisfy the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/8/d188c4697f3f7cf1889796a037bd60b6dae3b29e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x^{2}-5)^{2}=16?\\]\" width=\"119\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/7/b779e05974c865c3ea9a8c5f1b16e8c6b8d5d022.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }0\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }1\\qquad\\textbf{(C) }2\\qquad\\textbf{(D) }4\\qquad\\textbf{(E) }8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"353\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/f/61f91661e69159fd116d52f77c995bac95b5ebb2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x^2-5)^2 = 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"112\" height=\"19\" /> if and only if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/f/3bf4ccb0575ad7dcb642848c79d0c52128b92b0d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-5 = \\pm 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"96\" height=\"15\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/2/2a27786867053ea0121979df4f1fb4d6b2569a0e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-5 = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"82\" height=\"15\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/e/78ef0c6fb52088032cea848b349256bf5449d18e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 = 9 \\implies x = \\pm 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"158\" height=\"15\" />, giving 2 solutions. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/d/b7d3ba000136a681928630227f83ee1a477a2646.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-5 = -4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"96\" height=\"15\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/6/2761bde48134f422e54f87ae84d63407f6620862.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 = 1 \\implies x = \\pm 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"157\" height=\"15\" />, giving 2 more solutions. All four of these solutions work, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/0/e40af792bb8c6fd11211a2eee10e525fc7841b4f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D) }4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"56\" height=\"28\" />. Further, the equation is a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Quartic_Equation\" title=\"Quartic Equation\">quartic</a> in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, so by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/Fundamental_Theorem_of_Algebra\">Fundamental Theorem of Algebra</a>, there can be at most four real solutions.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can expand <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/d/58ded35f408e29fc6b660828d244939a989f3d13.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x^2-5)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"69\" height=\"19\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/c/e2c8c6148a38b5f3aff4f8066a3c4c06cce6616b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^4-10x^2+25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"116\" height=\"16\" />, so now our equation is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/9/2f9cb57b90d7daf7840d2ecfeec7bbf9ffe4e4e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^4-10x^2+25=16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"158\" height=\"16\" />. Subtracting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> from both sides gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/4/a64436e90b8d5e47cc3f50e6dcfa3dfd8504026c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^4-10x^2+9=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"143\" height=\"18\" />. Now, we can factor the left-hand side to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/f/65f2d99836cbaf1ed4205d4be09085757130e543.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x^2-9)(x^2-1)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"159\" height=\"19\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/e/15e525b84aee1c999b3a8873a4fc7e772dcf4815.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-9$\" width=\"48\" height=\"15\" /> and/or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/d/12d4054ebec147957eec30f900b2c2eb7c78028b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"48\" height=\"15\" /> equals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, then the entire left side will equal <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Since the solutions can be both positive and negative, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> solutions: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/4/c4462745d94d9a47494a072a4049139bb4036a2d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-3,3,-1,1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"88\" height=\"16\" /> (we can find these solutions by setting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/e/15e525b84aee1c999b3a8873a4fc7e772dcf4815.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-9$\" width=\"48\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/d/12d4054ebec147957eec30f900b2c2eb7c78028b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"48\" height=\"15\" /> equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and solving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />). So, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/0/e40af792bb8c6fd11211a2eee10e525fc7841b4f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D) }4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"56\" height=\"28\" />. Note: every positive root can also be shown as negative \n</p><p>~UnstoppableGoddess\n~Edits by WrenMath\n~Edits by Tarmac-boy\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Subtract 16 from both sides and factor using difference of squares: \n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/1/be1b88efca88930d266988540af92ce898f4898d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x^2 - 5)^2 = 16\\]\" width=\"111\" height=\"20\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/1/b617549377b984460a7e2964271fdd22895b900f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x^2 - 5)^2 - 16 =0\\]\" width=\"142\" height=\"20\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/9/0d9c002f8f719803ef6a268ac7ff9c6e34ba71df.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x^2 - 5)^2 - 4^2 = 0\\]\" width=\"141\" height=\"20\" />  \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/8/a48aa54688812c2cba181df8629fc5c92c6fb2ba.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[[(x^2 - 5)-4][(x^2 - 5) + 4] = 0\\]\" width=\"240\" height=\"20\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/2/d62ae7379617e3b86043089d0948c10356693f03.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x^2 - 9)(x^2 - 1) =0\\]\" width=\"158\" height=\"20\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/d/e8d4d49fec6f2ebc7441571c80e8949a41b22013.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x+3)(x-3)(x+1)(x-1) = 0.\\]\" width=\"258\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><br />\nQuite obviously, this equation has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/0/e40af792bb8c6fd11211a2eee10e525fc7841b4f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D) }4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"56\" height=\"28\" /> solutions. \n</p><p><br />\n~TaeKim\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/obC618_sVy8\">https://youtu.be/obC618_sVy8</a>\n</p><p>~TheSmartGreekMathDude\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_Math-X_.28First_understand_the_problem.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Math-X_(First_understand_the_problem!!!)\">Video Solution by Math-X (First understand the problem!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Math-X (First understand the problem!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/IgpayYB48C4?si=EHbnc8zZoQ15Gfv6&amp;t=6050\">https://youtu.be/IgpayYB48C4?si=EHbnc8zZoQ15Gfv6&amp;t=6050</a>\n</p><p>~Math-X\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_2\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Associated Video - <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q5yfodutpsw\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q5yfodutpsw</a>\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/0AY1klX3gBo\">https://youtu.be/0AY1klX3gBo</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/5BXh0JY4klM\">https://youtu.be/5BXh0JY4klM</a> (Uses a difference of squares &amp; factoring method, different from above solutions)\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_5_.28video_of_Solution_1.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5_(video_of_Solution_1)\">Solution 5 (video of Solution 1)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5 (video of Solution 1)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=44vrsk_CbF8&amp;list=PLLCzevlMcsWNBsdpItBT4r7Pa8cZb6Viu&amp;index=2\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=44vrsk_CbF8&amp;list=PLLCzevlMcsWNBsdpItBT4r7Pa8cZb6Viu&amp;index=2</a> ~ MathEx\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_DDM\">Video Solution by DDM</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by DDM\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/8hoLNLVo1Jo\">https://youtu.be/8hoLNLVo1Jo</a>\n</p><p>~piggydude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Pi_Academy\">Video Solution by Pi Academy</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Pi Academy\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Ds8Nzjj6pXs?si=QAwrO_bZHrTj6cba\">https://youtu.be/Ds8Nzjj6pXs?si=QAwrO_bZHrTj6cba</a>\n</p><p>~ smartschoolboy9\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_2_.28Gateway_to_Harder_Questions.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2_(Gateway_to_Harder_Questions)\">Video Solution 2 (Gateway to Harder Questions)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 2 (Gateway to Harder Questions)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=J-E4SGEi3QE&amp;t=2s\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=J-E4SGEi3QE&amp;t=2s</a>\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/V3HxkJhSn08\">https://youtu.be/V3HxkJhSn08</a> -Happytwin\n</p><p>Solution detailing how to solve the problem: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/x4cF3o3Fzj8\">https://youtu.be/x4cF3o3Fzj8</a>\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/dh9uf5_ZB5Q\">https://youtu.be/dh9uf5_ZB5Q</a> ~ Education, the Study of Everything\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Xm4ZGND9WoY\">https://youtu.be/Xm4ZGND9WoY</a> ~ Hayabusa1\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TpsuRedYOiM&amp;t=250s\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TpsuRedYOiM&amp;t=250s</a> ~ SpreadTheMathLove\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=13\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8\" title=\"2019 AMC 8\">2019 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2019 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2019 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2019\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2019 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2019 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2019 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2019 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2019 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"